<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10078"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Steve_huff<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Steve_huff<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 9:30 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->MSNBC has reported tonight that an undisclosed source revealed that Rader&#39;s computer yielded evidence of &#34;frequent&#34; posts to an online message board. Did not say which one. Started this thread to hopefully get some follow-up.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
