<!--Post: 10135--><!--Time: 1109781658-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10135"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Steve_huff<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Steve_huff<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 8:40 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Skov - I have been hunting for one, and haven&#39;t had a lot of luck. I&#39;ll keep it up. What is apparent right now is they reported it on-air - therefore there&#39;s no telling if it was just part of a rushed news script or is actually in a transcript.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
