<!--Post: 10144--><!--Time: 1109784976-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10144"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 9:36 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->OK thanks Steve, I´n very interested in knowing wether Rader was online on som forum, please keep me posted if you find anything, I´ll do the same<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10144-->
