<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10220"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:bmodule_244@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Bmodule<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bmodule<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 7:50 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Why would they want to hide BTK&#39;s posts?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10220-->
<!--Post: 10312--><!--Time: 1109893557-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10312"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Audreyamw<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Audreyamw<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 3:45 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Maybe D Rader did post at this site.  If his cryptic posts were part of a code of his, and LE has figured out his code, then there may be incriminating evidence in the posts.  Who knows, maybe the posts could contain incriminating evidence of cold cases that Dennis Rader hasn&#39;t yet confessed to.  They won&#39;t want Rader&#39;s defense team to get ahold of such info until they&#39;re done analyzing it.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10312-->
<!--Post: 10391--><!--Time: 1109919425-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10391"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 10:57 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I have a strange question, my computer is in plain site in my house so I can watch my kids on the net. Where do you think old Dennis&#39; putter is?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10391-->
<!--Post: 10397--><!--Time: 1109920171-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10397"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 11:09 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Speaking of computers and his probility of using them to post on message boards I also think he was being manipulitive of his minister when he asked how to use the church&#39;s computer to make a disc. He was just playing dumb. He knew how to use it. The reverend gave the right response that BTK wanted when police got around to asking him who had access to the computer. He had to ask me how to use it.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10397-->
<!--Post: 10401--><!--Time: 1109920728-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10401"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 11:18 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->You know what I was thinking the same thing, because of the ASC coded messages and the fact that he was looking up poems to steel parts from etc. He knew how to use a computer give me a break,<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10401-->
<!--Post: 10432--><!--Time: 1109954612-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10432"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Foxfire<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Foxfire<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 04, 2005 - 8:43 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think he was trying to throw even the pastor off in some way by asking him how to use the computer. <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10432-->
<!--Post: 10539--><!--Time: 1109990277-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10539"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Audreyamw<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Audreyamw<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 04, 2005 - 6:37 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Rader would have had to use a computer at work.  He had an email address at his place of employment, for crying out loud. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
